{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "ea4cef9ff36d07f10f6bd00f4163edfa882ccd469392bc96127a9b2b6b45ae7f", "ja": "本領発揮", "zh": "发挥本领", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a13881bcdebbdaee389dbe8d6a7802612797b370d0489c78badb2892f6c7631d", "ja": "いよいよ『#プレイリスト』の初回。全員で\n生配信に挑む。肩の力が抜けた一同のトーク\nは軽妙、杏奈の頼もしさもあって、視聴者と\nのやりとりや紬の食レポなど、大いに手応え\nのあるものとなるのだった。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e7442aaa2392b3e5bc4fa5d27d107a355807592bc90d823889e0c159e15c220", "ja": "（いよいよ『#プレイリスト』初回本番だ。\nいつもとは違った緊張感があるな……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1001_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1002_kirano", "source_sha256": "4f9a7ee12e6019122c396909656a8333093f9989f620b7bf53242441a2b3e40f", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす。\n今日が初回だって聞いて。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1003_moa", "source_sha256": "91cf2b6774b8d6489b2ea093b09a18134a46252c33bbff55c8091bdbc72f637b", "ja": "さぞ間抜けな配信が見れるんだろうなー♪\nって……ん……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1005_moa", "source_sha256": "f3f78d3301e7133b003298a316d4ae75b7ea0d1d9b280ed4d88af960d0335e50", "ja": "も、望月杏奈！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1006_kanon", "source_sha256": "148d1ff33f9706c3464a7f62e0a5020858b3ffefce126d29491ee1b1727bbfdc", "ja": "あれ、最近ゲーム配信してた子……？\n萌亞と同じゲームして同接上回ってた……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1007_moa", "source_sha256": "f97b6db2f93b11dc1fb6dd5b890b2c3b57e67cca9c64740b3d0ed79d7f77352f", "ja": "あ、あんなのたまたまだし！\nてか、今回いるなんて聞いてないんだけど……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "9fcae2c4b9ae41df4c7cb1566d5fc1c99a20500a516e599b41786b348b5e768d", "ja": "あ、うん、そうなの！\n杏奈、ちょっと遅れての参加なんだ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1009_kirano", "source_sha256": "e066b090e2a3112bf365644161f12568a0814525d279df44bbb52904b71d9000", "ja": "……面白くなってきたね。\n配信ちゃんとやってる奴、いるんならさ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1010_moa", "source_sha256": "499209474cbe06eeff8f19410608e17488fe21d612847e5019e22ca88674acb7", "ja": "はぁー、おもんな！\nもう行こ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "606c3be3f13c97f12047731c94da42dcc4251510437e7806ed9666cca39d9b40", "ja": "？？　{$P$}さん、\n杏奈、なんか変なこと言ったかな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "478f22c1b5c4cd8db9ffa9619a0b8d75a533f3666bd34c7c8b7cf770c2659be3", "ja": "気にしなくていいんじゃないかな。\nそれより、この後の本番に集中しよう！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "edeec8936a825814eedfecb144030d28a67668de0bd59e054704f3805b67eb70", "ja": "うん！　いつもの配信を見に来てくれる人は、\n杏奈や、ゲームを好きな人たちだけど……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "03615f3320d4b3815180d871f14d7ae88d76f9a51ac6e065dd2114e12c05e7a3", "ja": "今日の配信は、杏奈たちのファンの人だから！\n目いっぱい、楽しんでもらわなくちゃね♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "c2f6a090b09f2f56f251cd07340d55731f25ae650dcbd3b62e942f1bbaa94417", "ja": "そうだよね。\n私たちを、観に来てくれる人たちのために！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "9dc7d682d8a1f75af84a1bdcf731b5d2105643aa922cf89b42b95579601d96a1", "ja": "うん！　どこでもストリーミング～♪\n届けるよシング・ア・ソング～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6f3c24737c0d48d1f15207b49f3769aeb1e2c9fb8e902b9be05688ea9006852e", "ja": "縮こまったりせず、思いっきり\n私たちらしくいきましょう！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5141ea3b7b728d4441dda4f0cf978f3a427dd65ff5780f6ca06852fdce7229ab", "ja": "ああ！　思いっきり、\n765プロらしく振り抜いてきてくれ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "1b975077c7b445f68356587444f39f35e00cfcd715af112e3c078afc11657552", "ja": "あ、始まった……かな？\n大丈夫そ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1020_komento", "source_sha256": "ea328bb3d9f1ab9a71ff4e6388f9bc37fa18712f83ef824f7895956ab557527a", "ja": "「大丈夫！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1021_komento", "source_sha256": "271148ea5ea10b6eb43b966f2ab1ec10baea8871c855b041af5d05b675b85e35", "ja": "「わー、本当にネトスワに\n765プロのみんなが出てる！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "8ac99142b7c55ea8e30a7d19dbea04524a8275a63ca88ca2065a9caa92baec58", "ja": "よかった～。前みたいな配信トラブル起きなくて……。\nまずは安心～♪　この調子で前進～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1023_komento", "source_sha256": "dc6d7d5a6aa8f4c7caafa187b9da0cd252654c34f4c648e4a2d97fee13be1c5b", "ja": "「今日はこの間みたいに\n鼓膜の予備なくても平気そう笑」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1024_komento", "source_sha256": "9eb631745941ec0aca9f82e9ef4395255bc1ce708f5514801c6bfce8ec1f51f6", "ja": "「ミスから学べてえらい！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "4ec7d9dd813fb40cbbd0e417151d1f473bc81c531e22d5fb4ef00743fda3bc39", "ja": "でへへ～♪　あ、でもこれは音響さんが\nきちんと準備してくれたからなんですよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "99d37e046927584ebab01b90fb46fc62c51f2261f5928821702e1ad501129f9c", "ja": "そうですね。スタッフの方々には、\n本当によくしていただいています。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "525cabc933d03e04c3cc8c174027e7f5233134b2f9209d2866c5224d769e5f4e", "ja": "うん！　今日現場に来た時も\nお菓子たくさん用意してもらったし！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "ebfac83e1bf76f3e2dc27cb5ba8aa06100348e81d52c1af0f5859fa1304d3dfb", "ja": "キャラメルたっぷりのチョコバー！\n本当に山みたいに準備してあったよね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1029_komento", "source_sha256": "33e5fde563bd5c9edff4c39265fd5db8baffd93271838beb5309451d35cdbfcd", "ja": "「出た！　みんなもらうやつ！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1030_komento", "source_sha256": "760c8bcb838247ab1427d7ae158467930869ca2c610e19eb04887203f77a0746", "ja": "「出演者みんな言うけど、\n海外から取り寄せないとなんだよな～」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "283942dcba59140845e516daa2007959c0d4c6064a9c501f939c39222d762cfd", "ja": "そうなんだ！\nあのチョコバーって珍しいんだね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fe33241fbd36441b1bd87e2f5fa7f77a977257b25c7b610b65e33ec48a0b7907", "ja": "もしかすると……今度こそ食レポのチャンス、\nなのでしょうか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "19d9ebe26a311153fcca83ad448aa54d95e596af7e9cbe7e914e1288ad8d5b28", "ja": "以前は不甲斐ない所をお見せしてしまったので、\nぜひリベンジできればと。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1034_komento", "source_sha256": "85265d3ebe5fda9369be50245e27e1647164773753fdebba3496d5fd044b29f1", "ja": "「うわ気になるー！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1035_komento", "source_sha256": "43a6ded612bf4591157772e3743f08213ec5f00b81c80a76bceba7bef38e676f", "ja": "「確かに純和風な紬ちゃんが\nなんて言うのか気になるかも！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "cedbf3494b554aa7f14abf7df8e77660e7fc9eca7468f305a0accdbe05fcdd2c", "ja": "うん、それアリだと思う！\nチョコバー、用意してもらおっか！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "af3e26e41d4569965a2fbfb13d27f060b9cba65099c7e65a2aeeb0f53da1ff23", "ja": "それでは、失礼して……。\n…………。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1038_051tmg", "source_sha256": "448c9cc88ce7a278bb0d11006eecf74f19303903fa10e283f5136ef0c690fe0c", "ja": "ガツンと来る甘さですね。\n暴力的、とでも言いますか……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "f83c51853134c38caccb1e6dbe5bffa2f48f9cad88f64a437133a0a67fb484f7", "ja": "わかる！\n頭が、ぐらぐらーってするくらい甘いよね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1040_051tmg", "source_sha256": "700d48de17933adfac24238d25594c8da78ed8ea5cd7dee0dd1ecec921a09410", "ja": "しかし、数種類のパフも食感がよく、\nキャラメルからミルクの味もして……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "57fadd5c6c1934659ebcf368c3d60e08dc9420951cbadb5d60042142b5782781", "ja": "あ、確かに甘いは甘いけど、\nいろんな甘さがしたような……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "92551eb631aa9829cdfb592cb3c5fe2d42aa62b0ecd84d7c7d0082d824251e31", "ja": "和菓子は砂糖の種類で甘さの差を出しますが、\nこちらは甘さがもっと多様ですね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "63b23f7770eb756a6e7f1e6e7ba3f85a4475c88fbf00cac2816487432dce177b", "ja": "思いの外シンプルというより複雑なお菓子だと\n思います。飽きない味わいかと。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1044_komento", "source_sha256": "8e0ec50e23066eafbfa302eb2a117404cd53062823d199645759ec8453e083ca", "ja": "「へー、食べてみたすぎる！」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1045_komento", "source_sha256": "7880aa9e54ab014bbd4e5b9e64001a212f7d98cb8523ca0d97a8fb0db5dc7b17", "ja": "「いかにも海外のお菓子だと思ってたけど\nそう説明されると気になるなー」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "b2ad328d1bd1e21e57ebfdc911a3bf92388709c1a0c02a672b7199c2e30e7eac", "ja": "コメント大盛り上がりしてる！\n紬さんの食レポ、ビビッと100点満点だね☆", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1047_komento", "source_sha256": "ea869db2884161a7b62a2c0df259a03715e4128057e54c021e51abf85229eb11", "ja": "「みなさんのことは初見なんですが、\nいつもそんなに仲が良いんですか？」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1048_komento", "source_sha256": "f58931d4e4cfcb65e58484cd2c23019c5e487deff3ac82d9f1312861790a52c8", "ja": "「私も聞きたかった！　杏奈ちゃんと\nゲーム仲間だったりとか？」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1049_024ann", "source_sha256": "6030c6f4ddf9663f741c511feebc4e1d5dbbd65e1749540b48d030898e981f0a", "ja": "んー、パーティゲーくらいはするけど。\nこの中だと、ゲーマーなのは杏奈だけだね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1050_024ann", "source_sha256": "7b7f39155c19daaac1a28f00cc389bccc9243afc9b4d0b5a55e8faad84b084d3", "ja": "杏奈はゲーム休暇も取るくらい、\nゲーム好きなんだけど……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1051_024ann", "source_sha256": "78dc4dc059b2087670890b30698ebfd865951a960e3d13b61d79c4111fe180b9", "ja": "でも、今回は早めに切り上げたの！\nそれで、仕事に戻ってきちゃった♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1052_036kan", "source_sha256": "14f7fda0536d6237991c7f7d42299743dbce0af375c4936bb2debac09f1793a2", "ja": "あれ、そうだったの？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "8abb4777e4aa16bbcc933cec1ce0d49a94b5702be7b366f4471d79c9ea1b1533", "ja": "仕事詰まってた時期ゲームできなかったんでしょ？\nたっくさんプレイすればよかったのに。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "35d2fe72e0dc3d92181b2855c7d79ca1c6c4be8581844b821f60915a55163731", "ja": "まあね。でも満足するくらいはプレイしたし、\nそれよりなにより……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1055_024ann", "source_sha256": "43c83d7616c84b9577fd2465adeb2bf9c3a7537e9ada6088b9d122755ea6ba91", "ja": "ひとりでゲームばっかしてたら、\nみんなに会いたくなってきちゃったんだもん。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1056_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ef2093bc201dc055b19c027265b84e14829286b6668073c0207980e693716aca", "ja": "望月さん……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1057_024ann", "source_sha256": "90936f5b9fd32063094b471d15a74830133bf2545895e690d9db47b03fc67604", "ja": "やっぱり、みんなでレッスンしたりお仕事したり、\nアイドルしてる時が、一番楽しいから！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1058_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dc1929469d0bed2151678fc0f2a8e7d3bb7a44ecf96bd4c10357622d5e91b383", "ja": "そうですね……。\n私たちはやはり、アイドルですから！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_06_1059_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0b78cefbb39401fd140eee9c1cd819488ea2afa080ae06670ff7df23e5e99ad5", "ja": "次は、そんな私たちの新曲です。\nみなさん、どうぞ聴いてくださいまし！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
